-v (verbose mode in curl)                example: curl -v http://example.com
-x (proxy option in curl)                example: curl -x http://proxyserver:port http://example.com
-H (header option in curl)               example: curl -H "Content-Type: application/json" http://example.com
-d (data option in curl for sending data in POST requests)          example: curl -d "param1=value1&param2=value2" http://example.com
-i (include response headers in the output in curl)                 example: curl -i http://example.com

